TS28532_ProvMnS:CorrelatedNotification a rdfs:Class .

TS28532_ProvMnS:MoiChange a rdfs:Class .

TS28532_ProvMnS:NotifyEvent a rdfs:Class ;
    rdfs:comment "Note: Uses OpenAPI allOf - complex logical constraints partially supported in SHACL" .

